     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PRW01                     TEXT('Audit Request +
     A                                      Main Work File')
     A            RWXML         60A         COLHDG('XML File Key')
     A            RWCO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('Company')
